  `PartDesign::Body`. New refs are created as `Part::Part2DObjectPython` (the
  only Python-extensible type `PartDesign::Body::isAllowed()` accepts); the
  base type's geometry/attachment properties are hidden in the editor.
  `Create ConfigRef` also creates the reference in the **active** container
