- Validation surfacing: moved the structural check onto the cached snapshot
  (`TableSnapshot.problems()`, `Table.validate()` delegates to it) and added
  `TableValid` / `TableErrors` to ConfigRef, computed from the snapshot plus the
  property-name collisions `validate()` cannot see. `ConfigRefViewProvider`
